        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This is a process composed of two reactions represented by the terms &apos;GO:0052632 : citrate hydro-lyase (cis-aconitate-forming) activity&apos; and &apos;GO:0052633 : isocitrate hydro-lyase (cis-aconitate-forming) activity&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
