        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Catalysis of the reaction: a phosphoprotein + H2O = a protein + phosphate. Together with protein kinases, these enzymes control the state of phosphorylation of cell proteins and thereby provide an important mechanism for regulating cellular activity.</owl:annotatedTarget>
