        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Catalysis of the transmembrane transfer of an ion by a channel that opens when glutamate has been bound by the channel complex or one of its constituent parts.</owl:annotatedTarget>
