        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The inner, i.e. lumen-facing, lipid bilayer of the mitochondrial envelope. It is highly folded to form cristae.</obo:IAO_0000115>
