        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The directed movement of substances (such as macromolecules, small molecules, ions) into, out of or within a cell, or between cells, or within a multicellular organism by means of some agent such as a transporter or pore, involving a single organism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
