        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A biological process whose specific outcome is the progression of an integrated living unit: an anatomical structure (which may be a subcellular structure, cell, tissue, or organ), or organism over time from an initial condition to a later condition, involving only one organism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
