        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A respiratory chain located in the plasma membrane of a cell; made up of the protein complexes that form the electron transport system (the respiratory chain), associated with the plasma membrane. The respiratory chain complexes transfer electrons from an electron donor to an electron acceptor and are associated with a proton pump to create a transmembrane electrochemical gradient.</obo:IAO_0000115>
